  //EVENT DIALOGUE
  "OMEGAlinc.CSE.WizardUndergroundShops1_Dialogue1": "Greetings, @.",
  "OMEGAlinc.CSE.WizardUndergroundShops1_Dialogue2": "I have a favor I need to ask of you.",
  "OMEGAlinc.CSE.WizardUndergroundShops1_Dialogue3": "Say... have you ever been to those shops? The underground ones near Central Station?",
  "OMEGAlinc.CSE.WizardUndergroundShops1_Dialogue4": "Okay. Anyways... I've recently lost my very important spellbook. I feel like I last had it south of the big tree in the forest.",
  "OMEGAlinc.CSE.WizardUndergroundShops1_Dialogue5": "If you can find it, it will be worth your while.",
  "OMEGAlinc.CSE.WizardUndergroundShops1_Dialogue6": "Consider it a reward for your trouble.",
  "OMEGAlinc.CSE.WizardUndergroundShops1_Dialogue7": "Well, I'm brewing a potion and need to check on it. Goodbye.",

  "OMEGAlinc.CSE.WizardUndergroundShops2_Dialogue1": "Hello again, @.",
  "OMEGAlinc.CSE.WizardUndergroundShops2_Dialogue2": "You got my note?",
  "OMEGAlinc.CSE.WizardUndergroundShops2_Dialogue3": "Good. Come with me.",
  "OMEGAlinc.CSE.WizardUndergroundShops2_Dialogue4": "Come on!",
  "OMEGAlinc.CSE.WizardUndergroundShops2_Dialogue5": "I don't do this for many people.",
  "OMEGAlinc.CSE.WizardUndergroundShops2_Dialogue6": "I am opening this for you because you are always willing to help me.",
  "OMEGAlinc.CSE.WizardUndergroundShops2_Dialogue7": "Here goes...",
  "OMEGAlinc.CSE.WizardUndergroundShops2_Dialogue8": "Wow, after all these years, it still works!",
  "OMEGAlinc.CSE.WizardUndergroundShops2_Dialogue9": "I'll let you explore in your own time, but I just wanna say again, thank you.",
  "OMEGAlinc.CSE.WizardUndergroundShops2_Dialogue10": "Goodbye.",

  "OMEGAlinc.CSE.UndergroundDungeon1_Dialogue1": "You can hear an otherworldly voice... It says: 'MONSTERS THRIVE HERE. BE CAREFUL.'",

